{"unit_id":"geekyfoxlab__dsh-subagents#card-zh","repo":"geekyfoxlab/dsh-subagents","commit":"733a74c7de004cd2ae376f03fdb57fcabbe31c3c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagents（DSH 插件，适用于挂载标准技能与系统提示词的客户端）：为 DSH 增加一组可按需调用的子代理角色和多代理协作流程。它将 13 个路由、角色及工作流技能注册到共享技能目录，并在系统提示词中加入使用指引。主要能力包括代码侦察、资料研究、实现委派、代码审查、并行审查、顾问会和审查修复循环。适合希望用自然语言委派开发、研究或复核任务的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥或账号，需安装于支持 skills 与 systemPrompt 的 DSH profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-38","lib/index.js:142-159"]}
{"unit_id":"geekyfoxlab__dsh-subagents#card-en","repo":"geekyfoxlab/dsh-subagents","commit":"733a74c7de004cd2ae376f03fdb57fcabbe31c3c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagents adds 13 child-agent persona and workflow skills to DSH. They cover code scouting, research, implementation, review, councils, and review-fix loops. The plugin registers the skills and adds system prompt guidance. It supports natural-language delegation without extra keys or accounts.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-38","lib/index.js:142-159"]}
